# Primatech Field Relay 07. The surface relay overlooks a buried Company stasis wing.
# Arrival faces south along the old road. Amber marks the main power feed and blue the coolant and pickup route.
# The north lane and south pickup terrace meet the surrounding terrain at floor layer 7.
# The rear stair leads to the pickup terrace through a second bulkhead. Do not move the marked feet, controls, or gate cells.
name: signal_site
anchor: 0 0 0
palette:
  A = tuff
  B = tuff_brick_stairs[facing=east]
  C = deepslate_bricks
  D = polished_tuff
