signs:
  facility white glow = PRIMATECH | PAPER CO. | — | FIELD SERVICES
  relay_id yellow glow = RELAY 07 | ODESSA | — | SERVICE ACCESS
  relay yellow glow = FIELD RELAY | TEST CIRCUIT | — | PULL LEVER
  stasis white glow = STAIRS DOWN | SUBLEVEL 4B | — | STASIS WING
  isolator yellow glow = A · ISOLATOR | STASIS FEED | — | PULL LEVER
  bus yellow glow = AMBER LINE | MAIN BUS | — | KEEP CLEAR
  coolant light_blue glow = B · COOLANT | SECONDARY LOOP | — | PULL LEVER
  loop light_blue glow = BLUE LINE | RETURN FEED | — | STASIS WING
  vault white glow = STASIS WING | SUBLEVEL 4B | — | AUTHORIZED ONLY
  interlock yellow glow = GATE LOCK | A + B | — | DUAL INTERLOCK
  pod_a light_blue glow = STASIS A | OCCUPIED | — | TRANSFER BAY
  pod_b light_blue glow = STASIS B | OCCUPIED | — | TRANSFER BAY
  support light_blue glow = LIFE SUPPORT | BANK 4B | — | A + B
  service red glow = SERVICE | SEALED | — | NORTH CONDUIT
  egress light_blue glow = PICKUP | STAIRS UP | — | BLUE MARKERS
  pickup light_blue glow = EXTRACTION | CLEAR THE PAD | — | SIGNAL AT DESK
  beacon light_blue glow = PICKUP BEACON | TRANSMIT | — | PULL LEVER
  access white glow = FIELD ACCESS | STAIRS DOWN | — | SOUTH SLOPE
  upper white glow = PRIMATECH | RELAY 07 | — | STAIRS DOWN

